{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 32, :comments ["<b>Mazzaroth</b> — they are stars. Some say that the resh is a substitution for lamed, and they cite as parallel: וידע אלמנותיו (and his widows shall know [him]?). This is far-fetched." "<b>and Kesil</b> — I have already mentioned it."], :book :job, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 38, :notes {0 "Ibn Ezra cites the parallel as וידע אלמנותיו, which appears to be a partial or garbled reference to a verse; translated hyper-literally as it stands. The identity of the intended parallel is uncertain."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Job -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/eyov/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:05:06.303716158Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}